WEBVTT

00:00:09.493 --> 00:00:10.813
[Mater] He's done.

00:00:10.893 --> 00:00:14.133
He must've finished it
while we was all sleepin'.

00:00:14.173 --> 00:00:16.453
Good riddance.

00:00:24.333 --> 00:00:25.733
He's gone?

00:00:25.813 --> 00:00:28.813
Well, we wouldn't want him
to miss that race of his.

00:00:32.213 --> 00:00:34.213
[sniffing]

00:00:34.293 --> 00:00:38.613
- Oh, dude, are you crying?
- No! I'm happy!

00:00:38.653 --> 00:00:41.653
I don't have to watch him
every second of the day anymore!

00:00:41.733 --> 00:00:42.933
I'm glad he's gone!

00:00:43.013 --> 00:00:45.813
[blubbering, sobbing]

00:00:49.493 --> 00:00:51.333
What's wrong with Red?

00:00:51.373 --> 00:00:54.813
Oh, he's just sad
'cause you left town

00:00:54.853 --> 00:00:57.813
and went to your big race to win
the Piston Cup

00:00:57.853 --> 00:01:00.733
that you've always dreamed about
your whole life

00:01:00.813 --> 00:01:06.373
and get that big ol' sponsor and that
fancy helicopter you was talkin' about.

00:01:11.013 --> 00:01:13.293
[gasping] Wait a minute!

00:01:13.373 --> 00:01:14.613
[all laugh]

00:01:14.693 --> 00:01:17.533
I knowed you wouldn't leave
without saying goodbye.

00:01:17.573 --> 00:01:20.333
What are you doin' here?
You're gonna miss your race.

00:01:20.373 --> 00:01:24.053
Don't worry. I'll give you
a police escort, and we'll make up time.

00:01:24.133 --> 00:01:25.293
Thank you, Sheriff.

00:01:25.373 --> 00:01:27.493
But you know I can't go just yet.

00:01:27.573 --> 00:01:29.053
Well, why not?

00:01:29.133 --> 00:01:31.973
- I'm not sure these tires...
- [Luigi gasps excitedly]

00:01:32.053 --> 00:01:34.933
- ...can get me to California.
- Peet stop?

00:01:35.013 --> 00:01:38.253
Yeah, does anybody know
what time Luigi's opens?

00:01:38.373 --> 00:01:41.533
[laughing] I can't-a believe it!
Four new tires!

00:01:41.733 --> 00:01:44.333
Grazie, Mr. Lightning. Grazie!

00:01:44.413 --> 00:01:48.493
- Would you look at that!
- [Luigi] Our first customer in years!

00:01:48.573 --> 00:01:52.173
I am filled with tears of ecstasy,

00:01:52.253 --> 00:01:56.093
for this is the most glorious day
of my life!

00:01:56.173 --> 00:02:00.173
All right, Luigi, give me
the best set of blackwalls you've got.

00:02:00.373 --> 00:02:01.573
No! No, no, no.

00:02:01.653 --> 00:02:05.053
You don't-a know what you want.
Luigi know what you want.

00:02:06.173 --> 00:02:10.533
Blackwall tires.
They blend into the pavement.

00:02:10.613 --> 00:02:12.093
But-a this...

00:02:12.373 --> 00:02:14.213
Whitewall tires!

00:02:14.253 --> 00:02:19.453
They say, "Look at me!
Here I am! Love me."

00:02:19.533 --> 00:02:21.333
All right, you're the expert.

00:02:21.413 --> 00:02:24.333
- [snarling]
- [Lightning] Don't forget the spare.

00:02:24.413 --> 00:02:27.253
- Perfetto. Guido!
- Peet stop!

00:02:27.293 --> 00:02:29.613
[♪ Chuck Berry: Route 66]

00:02:38.613 --> 00:02:41.533
[laughing] What did Luigi tell you, eh?

00:02:41.613 --> 00:02:45.093
Wow, you were right.
Better than a Ferrari, huh?

00:02:45.853 --> 00:02:47.013
Eh... No.

00:02:50.893 --> 00:02:54.453
Wow! This organic fuel is great!
Why haven't I heard about it before?

00:02:54.573 --> 00:02:56.573
It's a conspiracy, man!

00:02:56.653 --> 00:02:59.093
The oil companies got a grip
on the government!

00:02:59.133 --> 00:03:02.413
They're feedin' us a bunch of lies, man.

00:03:02.493 --> 00:03:04.613
OK, I'll take a case.

00:03:19.653 --> 00:03:21.133
Ow! Eh!

00:03:21.173 --> 00:03:22.453
[Lightning yelps]

00:03:25.173 --> 00:03:27.893
- [chuckles]
- [breathes in deeply]

00:03:29.973 --> 00:03:31.573
[Ramone] Ah... Yeah.

00:03:32.133 --> 00:03:33.693
[Lightning] Ka-chow.

00:03:34.533 --> 00:03:37.493
- Here she comes!
- [Lightning] Places, everybody. Hurry!

00:03:37.573 --> 00:03:39.293
- Act natural.
- [whistling]

00:03:39.333 --> 00:03:40.693
- Hi, Sally.
- Buon giorno!

00:03:40.773 --> 00:03:42.613
All right, what's goin' on?

00:03:42.693 --> 00:03:44.853
Ladies and gentlecars,

00:03:44.893 --> 00:03:48.853
please welcome
the new Lightning McQueen!

00:03:49.493 --> 00:03:51.493
Pow! What do you think?

00:03:51.533 --> 00:03:53.733
Radiator Springs
looks pretty good on me.

00:03:53.813 --> 00:03:55.613
[chuckling] I'll say.

00:03:55.693 --> 00:03:58.853
[purring] Ka-chow.

00:03:58.933 --> 00:04:01.493
You're gonna fit right in
in California.

00:04:02.373 --> 00:04:05.493
My goodness. It looks like
you've helped everybody in town.

00:04:05.533 --> 00:04:07.373
Yeah, everybody except one.

00:04:08.613 --> 00:04:13.653
- Hey, is it getting dark out?
- What? What'd he say?

00:04:13.733 --> 00:04:16.733
Let me say that again.
Is it getting dark out?

00:04:16.813 --> 00:04:19.013
Now, what was I
supposed to do after that?

00:04:19.053 --> 00:04:21.413
[♪ The Chords: Sh-Boom]

00:04:43.013 --> 00:04:45.813
[gasping] They fixed their neon!

00:04:53.213 --> 00:04:58.213
- Low and slow?
- Oh, yeah, baby! [chuckling]

00:04:58.253 --> 00:05:00.893
[Flo laughs and shrieks]

00:05:02.533 --> 00:05:05.853
Just like in its heyday, right?

00:05:05.933 --> 00:05:09.253
It's even better than I pictured it.
Thank you.

00:05:30.933 --> 00:05:33.293
[chuckling]

00:05:36.733 --> 00:05:38.133
Shall we cruise?

00:05:38.213 --> 00:05:40.533
Oh, thank you, dear. I'd love to!

00:05:40.653 --> 00:05:42.093
- No, no, no.
- Lizzie!

00:05:42.133 --> 00:05:46.493
I remember when Stanley
first asked me to take a drive with him.

00:05:46.573 --> 00:05:49.453
Hey, Miss Sally.
May I have this cruise?

00:05:49.493 --> 00:05:52.853
- Of course, Mater.
- Uh-uh-uh!

00:05:54.333 --> 00:05:57.213
[mooing]

00:05:59.333 --> 00:06:03.693
...and again and I said, "No."
He asked me again, and I said, "No."

00:06:03.773 --> 00:06:08.133
But, oh, he was a persistent
little bugger for a two-cylinder.

00:06:08.173 --> 00:06:11.573
Finally I said,
"All right, one little drive."

00:06:13.733 --> 00:06:16.773
- Oh!
- [Mater chuckling]

00:06:21.093 --> 00:06:23.213
- Hey!
- Thanks, Mater.

00:06:23.293 --> 00:06:25.613
Good evenin', you two.

00:06:28.093 --> 00:06:33.373
Oh, Stanley,
I wish you could see this.

00:06:37.453 --> 00:06:41.253
- Is that what I think it is?
- Oh, I don't know, Flo.

00:06:41.333 --> 00:06:47.013
I haven't had a chance to find out.
But I am going to find out. Hello.

00:06:47.053 --> 00:06:49.653
Not that. That.

00:06:49.693 --> 00:06:52.133
[Sally gasps] Customers?

00:06:52.213 --> 00:06:54.893
Customers, everybody!
And a lot of 'em!

00:06:54.933 --> 00:06:57.093
You know what to do.
Just like we rehearsed.

00:06:57.173 --> 00:06:58.173
[all gasp]

00:06:58.213 --> 00:07:00.853
It's the ghostlight!

00:07:00.893 --> 00:07:03.493
We have found McQueen.
We have found McQueen!

00:07:04.373 --> 00:07:05.853
McQueen, over here!

00:07:05.893 --> 00:07:08.693
- Wait, excuse me.
- Is it true you've been in rehab?

00:07:08.733 --> 00:07:10.893
- Did you have a nervous breakdown?
- What?

00:07:10.933 --> 00:07:13.693
- McQueen's wearing whitewalls!
- Your tires balding?

00:07:13.733 --> 00:07:14.733
[Sally] Stickers!

00:07:14.813 --> 00:07:16.973
- Was McQueen your prisoner?
- Shoot, no!

00:07:17.053 --> 00:07:19.533
We're best buds!
I ain't braggin' or nothin',

00:07:19.573 --> 00:07:22.773
but I was in charge of huntin' him down
if he tried to escape.

00:07:22.853 --> 00:07:24.453
Sally! Sally!

00:07:24.533 --> 00:07:26.573
Will you still race for the Piston Cup?

00:07:26.653 --> 00:07:28.413
- Stickers?
- Sally!

00:07:28.453 --> 00:07:30.853
- Come on, give us some bolt!
- [horn honking]

00:07:30.933 --> 00:07:35.413
You're here!
Thank the manufacturer! You're alive!

00:07:35.493 --> 00:07:38.893
- Mack?
- You're here! I can't believe it!

00:07:38.933 --> 00:07:42.813
[chuckling] You are a sight
for sore headlights!

00:07:42.893 --> 00:07:45.613
I'm so sorry I lost you, boss.
I'll make it up to you!

00:07:45.693 --> 00:07:47.573
Mack, I, I can't believe you're here.

00:07:47.613 --> 00:07:50.213
[Harv] Is that the world's
fastest racing machine?

00:07:50.253 --> 00:07:52.813
- Is that Harv?
- Yeah. He's in the back.

